---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
    title="About Simon Morgan | Freelance Web Developer, London"
    description="18+ years' experience as a front end developer. Skilled in JavaScript, WordPress, Sanity, Astro, design systems & CMS platforms.">
    <section class="section">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="grid">
                <div class="grid-item grid-item--12">
                    <h1 class="">About</h1>
                </div>
                <div class="grid-item grid-item--8">
                    <p class="text-lg mt-0">
                        I've worked on all sorts of web projects over the years — for clients directly, and embedded within design, digital and communications
                        agencies of all sizes. I'm a front end focused developer with a strong working knowledge of the full stack, and I'm comfortable in
                        client-facing roles, translating business requirements into technical solutions.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        Over the years I've delivered everything from marketing websites and design systems to complex CMS-driven platforms for financial
                        services, investment and corporate clients — often working as an embedded contractor within agency teams, picking up projects mid-flow
                        or leading builds from the ground up.
                    </p>

                    <p>I care about writing clean, maintainable code that follows web standards, performs well, and is genuinely accessible.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="grid-item grid-item--4">
                    <p>Below is a summary of my main technical skills:</p>
                    <div>
                        <ul class="flow">
                            <li><strong>Javascript</strong> - Vanilla, Typescript, React</li>
                            <li><strong>CSS</strong> - SASS, BEM, Tailwind, Modules</li>
                            <li><strong>CMS</strong> - Wordpress, Sanity, Craft among other</li>
                            <li><strong>SSG</strong> - Astro, 11ty, Next, Gatsby</li>
                            <li><strong>Design systems</strong> - Custom 11ty sites, Storybook.js, Fractal.build</li>
                            <li><strong>Backend</strong> - PHP, mySQL, Node, Express</li>
                            <li><strong>Tools</strong> - GIT, Gulp, Webpack, Vite, Npm, Kinsta, AWS, Bitbucket CI Pipelines</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="grid-item grid-item--8">
                    <h2>How i work</h2>

                    <p>
                        I typically work on a freelance/contract basis — day rate or fixed project fee, depending on scope. I'm available for remote work across
                        the UK, and hybrid or on-site for London-based clients and agencies. I'm currently taking on new projects and always happy to have an
                        initial conversation to see if I'm a good fit.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>
